{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1069674-homebrew-ex3-creation-gate-total-alchemical-re-write","id":1069674,"title":"[Homebrew][Ex3] Creation Gate, total Alchemical re-write.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-03-28T15:46:54-07:00","id":1069674,"title":"[Homebrew][Ex3] Creation Gate, total Alchemical re-write.","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Hello everyone, in honor of the gameline being handed to Robert Vance &amp; Eric Minton, we thought we\u2019d release some of our work to everyone else so that maybe you can enjoy our vision of Autochthon at your table =) This labor of love has been several years in the making and mostly lives on a private wiki, but it has been copy/pasted for you all to use (and critique if you really want).</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">This has been the dedicated work of my best friend Sasha and arguably the best ST around, and myself. By no means is it complete (There\u2019s always room for more charms) but it\u2019s way more than enough to get someone started. Some design goals you should understand, however, before you get your feet wet:</span></span><ul><li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Essence levels aren\u2019t meant to have parity with other splats, the meat of this game is in essence 1, 2, and 3; essence 4 and 5 is reserved for the might of the colossus: Alchemicals whose bodies take on new shapes to fit all their new magic and responsibility. From Giant humanoids to vehicles to more esoteric forms ( Giant mechanical void eating serpent anyone ? ). Expect to see a lot of action packed into Essence 1 and don\u2019t be so quick to jump to 2 just yet.</span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Alchemicals are designed to be modular and change to meet their problems prepared for whatever danger they may face. They get access, temporarily, to any charm for which the prerequisites they meet at the cost of a very limited pool of personal essence. But that won\u2019t stop a champion from building an iconic set of charms they always have with them.</span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Alchemical champions, first and foremost, are human. Their struggle for humanity should be at the core of their identity and the loss of that results in clarity/dissonance; their Limit mechanic measures the ebb and flow of stress and their groundedness to the people around them.</span></span></li> </ul><br /> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tGxunG6.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Character Creation</span></span></b><ul><li><u><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/11NZnPb84yMwrap7BNRzfAjooyefRiUje8wrXB8EBbPg/edit\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Alchemical Champion's Handbook, the guide to playing an Alchemical Hero of your Nation.</span></span></a></u></li> <li><u><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1eq7bsTGoi-c92UNNjufkKsxMfm9i8J_Vt8HkrYJL8so/edit\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Autochtonian Hero's Handbook, the guide to playing a Mortal Hero of your Nation.</span></span></a></u></li> </ul><br /> <b> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">New Rules</span></span></b><ul><li><u><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1MAIAjj_WQV3cZnUIZGMZ9c2XcS1txGuojm7sA_UvBDI/edit\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Artifacts, Magitech &amp; Imprinting</span></span></a></u></li> <li><u><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1H1ejmswg__8gI7aEFJ2NHfB4T2hfhH85FblW5S1rvxk/edit\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Firearms &amp; New Weapon Tags</span></span></a></u></li> <li><u><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1wxZ4Kqr5vVWhqFWcCKKwIk4Q6cEF2xSR55rw9oL_vQw/edit\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Health &amp; Medicine Revamp</span></span></a></u></li> <li><u><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1LGbzFTEAYc0o1XJBSCmtXID0xhniQk0JF2uncN8XP90/edit\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Vehicles &amp; Mounted Combat</span></span></a></u></li> <li><u><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/105ltu6G-FeNB23J-YIkAJ-lCizfvN9J-pjrnoTDj_j4/edit\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Character Advancement</span></span></a></u></li> </ul><br /> <b> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Mechanical Content (some pun intended)</span></span></b><ul><li><u><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/19tvMclSL_l5AfHyb70S4lqUBu9BVdXYlW1NKtRiG8Cs/edit\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Autocthonian Merits</span></span></a></u></li> <li><u><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hnIWVgejspo9sRaHArC1X5Mx6yliso35YXb0Ib3YGNQ/edit\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Charms &amp; Protocols</span></span></a></u></li> </ul><br /> <b> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Our World</span></span></b><ul><li><u><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1DN-HA5GChYvYA936pJ1pgA54rGz0ArI7U27AfS_Ikt4/edit\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Lexicon</span></span></a></u></li> <li><u><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1yszV3pL8PvYRKhSgzfl9zOY2qsWM0eb9KTtF4nDY7HM/edit\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Autochtonian Nations</span></span></a></u></li> <li><u><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/12IhVN0OcKeQliMJWakBHGtuMsgwpj2vMNT09AsWmFR8/edit\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Archives of Mechanical Wisdom</span></span></a></u></li> </ul><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Art found within is taken from all over the web, it\u2019s a fan based project. If you want your image removed shoot me a forum message and I\u2019ll have it take off the document. The flags for the nations are \u00a9 Sasha. If you don\u2019t know who Exalted \u00a9 belongs to, you\u2019re in the wrong place.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Special thanks to: Sandact6, whose early work and names we took a whole bunch of inspiration from, and BadassOverlord as a player and contributor to a charm or two.</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1759,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1759-kawaiiwolf","user":"kawaiiwolf","date":". 03-28-2017, 06:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1759-kawaiiwolf","name":"kawaiiwolf","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1759_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"155"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-28T16:47:38-07:00","id":1069713,"title":"","content":"I'm really digging this.<br /> <br /> Where is the powerful keyword defined? Did I miss it somewhere?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Enjoy the adventures of a socially awkward Godblooded that tries to make her way through the world.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1055342-halfway-quest\" target=\"_blank\">Halfway</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11319-finn523","name":"Finn523","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-28T18:21:10-07:00","id":1069761,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Finn523</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1069674-homebrew-ex3-creation-gate-total-alchemical-re-write?p=1069713#post1069713\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm really digging this.<br /> <br /> Where is the powerful keyword defined? Did I miss it somewhere?</div> </div> </div> </div>Page 590 of the Core.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1311230-badassoverlord-s-assorted-homebrew-folder\" target=\"_blank\">Are you in the market for some Martial Arts? Perhaps some custom Artifacts for your campaign?</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10131-badassoverlord","name":"BadassOverlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10131_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"322"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-04T15:00:28-07:00","id":1073383,"title":"","content":"More than just the mechanical goodies, do take a look at <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/12IhVN0OcKeQliMJWakBHGtuMsgwpj2vMNT09AsWmFR8/edit\" target=\"_blank\">The Archives of Mechanical Wisdom</a>. It's probably gotten the best overhaul, taking the overcrowded industrial dystopia and transformed it into a functional egalitarian (if oligarchic) functional society, one rich with passion and the ingenuity of the human spirit. It's not just the exalted and the empowered who are the movers and shakers, rather they're just the celebrities and adored (and the best caretakers a populate could ask for). Each nation does have it's focus though, so if you're still looking for your dystopic north korean vibe, Estasia is still a fascist nation rife with military expansions. This of course comes at the cost of other focus, where as other nations try to branch toward the expanse of culture, the arts or technology. They're all triumphs of the human spirit, for better or worse.<br /> <br /> Another big change was to the social castes. Sodalites have shifted from their original guild like associations to represent the totality of knowledge and academia: The names, kept as a historical tribute, have evolved to encompass things such as the social sciences (psychology, sociology, etc) for Luminators, Fundamental sciences (physics, chemestry, etc) for the Harvesters. Autocthonian religious castes and roles clearly defined in scope and a religious ideal (loosely based off the Ultima series) applied as a guide to better influence the humanist perspective of Autocthonia. A brand new branch was added to represent the brave souls who risk most of their life out in the reaches, collecting salvage, raw materials or discovering new depths of Autocthonia's seemingly endless techno-organic landscapes.<br /> <br /> Were you to only read one thing, I'd start here, it's the heart and the soul of the world and without that, Exalted is just a bunch of interesting simulation mechanics.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1759-kawaiiwolf","name":"kawaiiwolf","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1759_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"155"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-12-18T07:43:10-08:00","id":1556790,"title":"","content":"I know this is an ancient thread and I've messaged you about this before, but this is really great stuff. It's definitely become my headcannon for Autochthonia.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23672-detson","name":"Detson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23672_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}